window.RP_SESSION={"id":"S-0ae895b2fbc1","messages":[{"id":"RP-II-0030235","time":"2026-02-04T14:52:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 스카일라 왕국에서 쫀득쿠키라는 것이 유행한다는 소문을 들은 머독은 이내 스쫀쿠에 대해 찾기로 결심 했습니다. \"\n\n아- 스쫀쿠라는 것이 있던데 들어본 적 있소이까?","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030236","time":"2026-02-04T14:56:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"먼저 확인 한 것은 길드게시판입니다.\n\n로비에 내려와 게시판에 붙은 뉴-스는 없는지...\n\n머독의 눈에는...","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030237","time":"2026-02-04T14:56:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!지능","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030238","time":"2026-02-04T14:56:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'The Heavy 핀 머독'의 지능 판정 :\n[11] + [0] = [11]\n결과 : 완벽한 성공, 운명은 당신의 편입니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-II-0030239","time":"2026-02-04T14:56:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 있-다-!!!! \"","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030240","time":"2026-02-04T14:56:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"있습니다!\n\n스쫀쿠 소식-!!","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030241","time":"2026-02-04T14:57:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"스텔라 스타라이트","profile":"스텔라 스타라이트","identity":"unresolved","type":"dialogue","body":"엥? 드라고니안 구강구조상 쫀득하니 입에 달라붙는게 유행할리가 없는데?","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-II-0030242","time":"2026-02-04T14:57:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"스텔라 스타라이트","profile":"스텔라 스타라이트","identity":"unresolved","type":"dialogue","body":"모함이오!","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-II-0030243","time":"2026-02-04T14:58:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"유행이란게 괜히 유행입니까?\n\nY2K 스타일링이 유행하던 세이클럽 시절엔 그게 '멋'의 기준이었습니다.\n\n유행에 이유가 있겠습니까?\n유행의 이유는 유행입니다.\n\n불편함을 감수하는 것.\n\n그것이 멋- 이란 어이없는 유행이었겠죠.","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030244","time":"2026-02-04T15:00:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 헛간을 청소하면 스쫀쿠 2개를 무료로 준다고? 잠깐... 일을하고 받는거면 무료가 아니잖아. 무튼... \"\n\n스카일라 인근 마을에서 \"헛간 청소\"를 도우면 스쫀쿠 두 개를 준다는 소식. 이게. 뉴스?\n\n아닙니다. 의뢰서군요!","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030245","time":"2026-02-04T15:05:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"보자보자. 어디보자.\n\n마을 이름이...\n\neilas'ti ?\n\n요상한 이름입니다.\n\n의뢰서에 그려진 약도를 보니 마차를 타고 밤낮을 달려 이틀 께나 걸리는군요.\n\n\" 먼 거리군. 하지만 스쫀쿠를 향한 여정을 포기할 순 없네. 어떻소, 함께 가겠나? \"","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030246","time":"2026-02-04T16:02:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"엘타리온","profile":"레마 캐롤라인","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 누가 봐도 마을 이름부터 구라잖아! \"","characters":["P-cf2651679b0b"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030247","time":"2026-02-04T16:02:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 구라...!? \"","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030248","time":"2026-02-04T16:04:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"엘타리온","profile":"레마 캐롤라인","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 마을 이름... 거꾸로 읽어봐요 머독. \"\n\n엘타리온은 머독의 반짝이는 머리에 비친 마을 이름을 읽은걸까요?","characters":["P-cf2651679b0b"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030249","time":"2026-02-04T16:06:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"eilas'ti...\n\n아일라스티...\n\n티스라일아?\n\n\" 뭔 말이오? \"","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030250","time":"2026-02-04T16:13:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"엘타리온","profile":"레마 캐롤라인","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" It's a lie... \"","characters":["P-cf2651679b0b"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030251","time":"2026-02-04T16:16:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" its a lying? kkk, y r u making such a joke 2 me? 😂 \"\n\nhe laughed.","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030252","time":"2026-02-04T16:21:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"엘타리온","profile":"레마 캐롤라인","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"😮","characters":["P-cf2651679b0b"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030253","time":"2026-02-04T16:34:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"“wait... hold up bro.. so, u saying you didn’t lie 2 me, that a just the phrase that says 'its a lie'? ... right?\"","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030254","time":"2026-02-04T16:34:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" but why? \"","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030255","time":"2026-02-04T16:36:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"엘타리온","profile":"레마 캐롤라인","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" Yes that I mean. It's a lie... eilas'ti... 문장부호까지 너무 정직하잖아요. \"","characters":["P-cf2651679b0b"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030256","time":"2026-02-04T16:38:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" ...!? \"\n\n머독은 찌익- 의뢰지를 뜯어 들여다봤습니다.\n\n거꾸로... 뒤집어보니 이건 영 말이 안되고...\n\n뒤집어서...\n\n잘 안보이네요. 흠.","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030257","time":"2026-02-04T16:38:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!지능","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030258","time":"2026-02-04T16:38:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'The Heavy 핀 머독'의 지능 판정 :\n[11] + [0] = [11]\n결과 : 완벽한 성공, 운명은 당신의 편입니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-II-0030259","time":"2026-02-04T16:39:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 아하! 혹시...!? \"\n\n의뢰서를 든 채 창가로 움직입니다.\n\n그리곤 반대로 뒤집은 외뢰서를 햇빛 가까이 가져다댔습니다.\n\n보입니다!\n\n햇빛에 비춰져 뒤짚어진 글씨...!\n\neilas'ti ...\n\nit'salie ...!\n\n ... it's a lie ... !!!","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030260","time":"2026-02-04T16:40:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"엘타리온","profile":"레마 캐롤라인","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 그래요, 그거에요! \"","characters":["P-cf2651679b0b"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030261","time":"2026-02-04T16:40:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"사진","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030262","time":"2026-02-04T16:40:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"잘했어...!!","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030263","time":"2026-02-04T16:40:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"퍼즐을 찾았구ㄴ... 이게 아니죠!!","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030264","time":"2026-02-04T16:41:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 이런 천인 공노할 녀석들...!! 스쫀쿠로 사람을 낚아...!!? \"","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030265","time":"2026-02-04T16:44:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"엘타리온","profile":"레마 캐롤라인","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 사람 낚는 어부들... \"","characters":["P-cf2651679b0b"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030266","time":"2026-02-04T16:45:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 엘도라도양. 이건 그냥 넘어갈 수 없소. 스쫀쿠로 사람을 낚아 대체 무슨 짓을 벌이는진 모르겠지만, 더 많은 피해자가 나오기 전에 방법해야하네.\n\n이건... 사건이오...!! \"","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030267","time":"2026-02-04T16:52:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"사건이오-! 이오- 이오- 이오...\n\n분노한 머독의 외침이 메아리쳤습니다.\n\n이 메아리는... 천인공노할 사기꾼들에게 닿았을까요?","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030268","time":"2026-02-04T16:52:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"머독","profile":"어설픈 용 ⃢맹","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"-fin","characters":["P-87b04eb56606"]},{"id":"RP-II-0030269","time":"2026-02-04T16:52:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"-fin","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-II-0030270","time":"2026-02-04T16:57:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"엘타리온","profile":"레마 캐롤라인","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" 조지러 갑시다! \"","characters":["P-cf2651679b0b"]}]};
